<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us | SNPN</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        /* Specific styles for the About page to match the new aesthetic */
        .page-header {
            background-color: var(--primary-blue);
            color: var(--text-white);
            padding: 60px 10%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: inset 0 -10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .page-header h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .page-header p {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .about-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            padding: 0 5%;
        }
        .about-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-white);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 50px;
            box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
        }
        .about-card h2 {
            color: var(--primary-blue);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 28px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-blue);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .about-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .profile-section {
            display: flex;
            gap: 50px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .profile-image {
            width: 250px;
            height: 250px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border: 5px solid var(--bg-white);
        }
        .profile-info h3 {
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .profile-info h4 {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        
        /* Make it stack nicely on mobile phones */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .profile-section {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <div class="page-header">
        <h1>About SNPN</h1>
        <p>Advancing Neuropeptide & Neuroendocrine Research in India</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-container">
        
        <div class="about-card">
            <h2>Our Mission & Vision</h2>
            <p class="about-text">The Society of Neuropeptides and Neuroendocrinology (SNPN) was established with a singular vision: to foster collaboration, ignite innovation, and support groundbreaking research in the fields of neuropeptides and neuroendocrinology across India and globally.</p>
            <p class="about-text">By providing a platform for both eminent scientists and emerging researchers, SNPN aims to facilitate the exchange of ideas, promote educational initiatives, and drive scientific inquiry that addresses crucial biological and medical challenges in neuroscience.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
            <h2>Our Founding President</h2>
            <div class="profile-section">
                <img src="/images/founder.jpg" alt="Prof. Nishikant Subhedar" class="profile-image">
                
                <div class="profile-info">
                    <h3>Prof. Nishikant Subhedar</h3>
                    <h4>Founding President, SNPN</h4>
                    <p class="about-text">Prof. Nishikant Subhedar has been a pioneering force in the realm of neuroendocrinology. His lifelong dedication to advancing the field laid the fundamental groundwork for the creation of SNPN.</p>
                    <p class="about-text">Throughout his illustrious career, he has mentored countless students, led critical research projects, and championed the necessity of a dedicated society to unite researchers. His vision and leadership continue to inspire the society's current and future endeavors.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>